"text":"The Swedes were the first to recognize that public officials like civil servants, police officers,","start":40.58,"end":47.25,"score":0.905,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-005-p02","sourceId":"b3-053-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[15,34],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"health inspectors or tax-collectors can make mistakes or act over-zealously in the belief that they are serving the public.","start":47.56,"end":56.08,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-006","sourceId":"b3-053-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"As long ago as 1809, the Swedish Parliament introduced a scheme to safeguard the interest of the individual.","start":56.78,"end":65.26,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-007","sourceId":"b3-053-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"A parliamentary committee representing all political parties appoints a person who is suitably qualified to investigate private grievances against the State.","start":65.96,"end":76.56,"score":0.98,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-008","sourceId":"b3-053-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The official title of the person is 'Justiteombudsman', but the Swedes commonly refer to him as the 'J.O.'","start":77.23,"end":85.803,"score":0.724,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-009","sourceId":"b3-053-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,2],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"or 'Ombudsman'.","start":86.02,"end":87.53,"score":0.911,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-010","sourceId":"b3-053-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The Ombudsman is not subject to political pressure.","start":88.02,"end":91.38,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-011","sourceId":"b3-053-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He investigates complaints large and small that come to him from all levels of society.","start":91.86,"end":97.47,"score":0.994,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-012","sourceId":"b3-053-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"As complaints must be made in writing, the Ombudsman receives an average of 1, 200 letters a year.","start":98.06,"end":105.96,"score":0.967,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-013","sourceId":"b3-053-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He has eight lawyer assistants to help him and he examines every single letter in detail.","start":106.9,"end":112.71,"score":0.935,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-014","sourceId":"b3-053-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"There is nothing secretive about the Ombudsman's work, for his correspondence is open to public inspection.","start":113.42,"end":119.94,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-015","sourceId":"b3-053-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If a citizen's complaint is justified the Ombudsman will act on his behalf.","start":120.7,"end":126.07,"score":0.97,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-016","sourceId":"b3-053-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The action he takes varies according to the nature of the complaint.","start":126.81,"end":130.6,"score":0.996,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-017","sourceId":"b3-053-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He may gently reprimand an official or even suggest to parliament that a law be altered.","start":131.26,"end":137.07,"score":0.965,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-018","sourceId":"b3-053-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The following case is a typical example of the Ombudsman's work.","start":137.92,"end":141.99,"score":0.973,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-019-p01","sourceId":"b3-053-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"A foreigner living in a Swedish village wrote to the Ombudsman complaining that he had been ill-treated by the police,","start":142.98,"end":150.38,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-019-p02","sourceId":"b3-053-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[20,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"simply because he was a foreigner.","start":150.81,"end":152.88,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-020","sourceId":"b3-053-020","sourceIndex":19,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The Ombudsman immediately wrote to the Chief of Police in the district asking him to send a record of the case.","start":153.57,"end":160.12,"score":0.965,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-021","sourceId":"b3-053-021","sourceIndex":20,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"There was nothing in the record to show that the foreigner's complaint was justified and the Chief of Police strongly denied the accusation.","start":160.88,"end":169.33,"score":0.977,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-022-p01","sourceId":"b3-053-022","sourceIndex":21,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It was impossible for the Ombudsman to take action, but when he received a similar complaint from another foreigner in the same village,","start":170.05,"end":178.54,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-022-p02","sourceId":"b3-053-022","sourceIndex":21,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[23,34],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"he immediately sent one of his lawyers to investigate the matter.","start":179.02,"end":182.92,"score":0.964,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-023","sourceId":"b3-053-023","sourceIndex":22,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The lawyer ascertained that a policeman had indeed dealt roughly with foreigners on several occasions.","start":183.6,"end":190.37,"score":0.94,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-024","sourceId":"b3-053-024","sourceIndex":23,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The fact that the policeman was prejudiced against foreigners could not be recorded in the official files.","start":190.95,"end":197.18,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-025","sourceId":"b3-053-025","sourceIndex":24,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It was only possible for the Ombudsman to find this out by sending one of his representatives to check the facts.","start":197.8,"end":204.71,"score":0.986,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-026","sourceId":"b3-053-026","sourceIndex":25,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The policeman in question was severely reprimanded and was informed that if any further complaints were lodged against him, he would be prosecuted.","start":205.38,"end":213.99,"score":0.985,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-053-027","sourceId":"b3-053-027","sourceIndex":26,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The Ombudsman's prompt action at once put an end to an unpleasant practice which might have gone unnoticed.","start":214.56,"end":221.06,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
